WEBVTT

01:07:59.125 --> 01:08:02.184
AG: Well, this has been fun
and enlightening as always.

01:08:02.208 --> 01:08:03.518
EP: Yes, I like it too.

01:08:03.542 --> 01:08:08.268
AG: I want to say thanks to the audience
and thanks to Esther for doing this.

01:08:08.292 --> 01:08:09.601
EP: Thank you to all.

01:08:09.625 --> 01:08:11.250
(Applause)

01:08:15.292 --> 01:08:16.851
AG: Next time on WorkLife.

01:08:16.875 --> 01:08:20.518
Carmen Medina: I recognized that
the only way I could survive at the CIA

01:08:20.542 --> 01:08:22.976
was that I had to give up.

01:08:23.000 --> 01:08:28.226
So yes, in that sense,
I became less authentic.

01:08:28.250 --> 01:08:31.893
AG: The double-edged sword,
bringing your whole self to work.